# Requirements register — {{CLIENT_NAME}}

**A requirement with no `Source:` is not a requirement.** Route it to `open-questions.md`, or tag it `ASSUMPTION` with a named owner and a confirm-by date.

**Confidence:** `verified` (observed or system evidence) · `UNVERIFIED` (stated evidence only — must be verified before build) · `ASSUMPTION` (no evidence).

Never quietly upgrade a confidence class. Promotion needs new evidence and a citation to it.

**Acceptance criteria must be able to fail.** If you cannot describe the input and output that would constitute a failure, you have written a hope. Never invent an AC for someone else's requirement — ask.

