## Assumptions

Every assumption needs an owner, a confirm-by date, and **what breaks if it is wrong** — that last field is what turns it into a managed risk rather than a permanent guess.

| Req id | Assumption (stated positively) | Owner | Confirm by | What breaks if wrong |
